WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.601
Hey! It's me, Fred Noseit.

00:00:02.211 --> 00:00:04.668
This website is for all you folks who work in education.

00:00:05.377 --> 00:00:06.381
Every helper here is free.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.669
Just pick who you are, tap your helper, and ask away.

00:00:10.341 --> 00:00:13.172
And wait till you see the Plugin Store — there's nothing else like it.

00:00:13.873 --> 00:00:19.805
Teachers and parents build their own plugins, sell what they know, and you can buy help made by real teachers, just for you.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.865
I nose it — so you don't have to!
